<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/d5-2026-11-09> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Decision D5: the meaning of the type (prefLabel, definition, subClassOf) is kept apart from the rest. The six-phase position moves from skos:broader to pp:phase (classification); profile, processDescription and provenanceClass move to a node of their own (pp:deployment); the openEO correspondences are grouped apart. The plan was already a node of its own." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-09T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/fixed-role-values-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "fixedRoleValues added: the optional role index of radiometric-index-single-band is fixed to \"normalized difference\", the (A-B)/(A+B) the tool always computes (decision C3 of 2026-11-10)." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/inherited-description-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "processDescription.inherited.json added with the attachment to the Implementation Profile radiometric-index-single-band: the deployed processDescription with each bound input and output linked to the role it implements (metadata, role implementation-input or implementation-output) and carrying that role's dataType; the profile schema inherits it. The deployed processDescription is unchanged." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/plan-2026-11-11> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "plan: executionUnit.href moves from GeoLabs/ogc-eo-application-package-hands-on f472585 to 72a76ae, pushed on 2026-11-11 (water-bodies/app-pkg-multiple/norm_diff.cwl). The 72a76ae CWL declares the format of its Files, so the processDescription derived from it changes: contentMediaType application/octet-stream -> image/tiff; application=geotiff (with contentEncoding binary) for the input rasters and the output ndwi, in processDescription.json and processDescription.inherited.json. The assumedFormatGaps recorded at the attachment on 2026-11-10 for rasters and ndwi were removed the same day, when the corrected CWL served these formats; the entry has none." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-11T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/specialisation-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "subClassOf changes from https://w3id.org/ogc/rim/activity-type/ActivityType to https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/activity-type/radiometric-index, the activity type of the operation in bblocks-generic-profiles (decision of 2026-11-10), with the same entity type(s): http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature, http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#Feature." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/tier3-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "Attached to the Implementation Profile https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/radiometric-index-single-band (implementsProfile), after checking its signature (docs/ATTACHMENTS.md)." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/unbound-roles-2026-11-10> a rim:RegisterAction ;
    dcterms:description "unboundRoles added: the role index of radiometric-index-single-band (minOccurs 0) is left unbound, no input selecting the index (decision C2 of 2026-11-10)." ;
    prov:startedAtTime "2026-11-10T00:00:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    rim:actionType pp:amendmentAction ;
    rim:appliesTo <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> ;
    rim:changeClassification rim:substantiveChange ;
    rim:proposer pp:geolabs .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process/norm_diff> rdfs:seeAlso <https://ospd.example.org/ogc-api/processes/norm_diff> ;
    pp:version "1.4.1" .

<https://ospd.example.org/ogc-api/processes/norm_diff/package> a prov:Plan ;
    dcterms:license <https://spdx.org/licenses/CC-BY-SA-4.0> ;
    pp:cwlClass "CommandLineTool" ;
    pp:cwlId "norm_diff" ;
    proc:executionUnit [ dcterms:format "application/cwl+yaml" ;
            ns1:relation <http://www.opengis.net/def/rel/ogc/1.0/executionUnit> ;
            oa:hasTarget <https://github.com/GeoLabs/ogc-eo-application-package-hands-on/raw/72a76ae1d5ff7e2ea67cf3fd05082893b359afa0/water-bodies/app-pkg-multiple/norm_diff.cwl> ] .

<https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff> a owl:Class,
        pp:ProcessType,
        acttype:ActivityType ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/activity-type/radiometric-index> ;
    skos:closeMatch <https://www.opengis.net/def/bblocks/ogc.openeo.processes.math.indices.normalized_difference> ;
    skos:definition "Computes the normalized difference index ((A-B)/(A+B)) of two co-registered rasters." ;
    skos:inScheme pp:process-type ;
    skos:prefLabel "Normalized difference between two rasters" ;
    pp:deployment [ pp:processDescription <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process/norm_diff> ;
            pp:profile "ospd.process-profiles.water-bodies.norm-diff" ;
            pp:provenanceClass wfprov:ProcessRun ] ;
    pp:fixedRoleValue [ rdf:value "normalized difference" ;
            skos:note "the tool computes (A-B)/(A+B) of rasters[0] and rasters[1] (app.py); which index it is depends on the bands passed (NDWI for green and NIR in W3)" ;
            pp:implements <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/radiometric-index-single-band/inputs/index> ;
            pp:side "inputs" ] ;
    pp:implementsProfile <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/radiometric-index-single-band> ;
    pp:openeoEquivalence [ pp:equivalenceLevel "closeMatch" ;
            pp:rationale "Exact index formula, generic over which two bands are passed: NDWI (green, nir) in this workflow, same as `ogc.openeo.processes.math.indices.normalized_difference` used for NDVI elsewhere in this register (`kindgrove.mangrove`) -- it is the caller's band choice, not the tool, that names the index." ] ;
    pp:phase <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/phase/scientific-computation> ;
    pp:plan <https://ospd.example.org/ogc-api/processes/norm_diff/package> ;
    pp:unboundRole [ skos:note "no input selects the index: the tool computes the normalized difference (A-B)/(A+B) of the two rasters" ;
            pp:implements <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-generic-profiles/def/implementation-profile/radiometric-index-single-band/inputs/index> ;
            pp:side "inputs" ] ;
    acttype:generatedEntityType geo:Feature ;
    acttype:usedEntityType geo:Feature ;
    rim:hasAction <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/addition>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/d5-2026-11-09>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/fixed-role-values-2026-11-10>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/inherited-description-2026-11-10>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/plan-2026-11-11>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/specialisation-2026-11-10>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/tier3-2026-11-10>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff/actions/unbound-roles-2026-11-10> ;
    rim:inRegister pp:register ;
    rim:itemClass acttype:activityTypeItemClass ;
    rim:objectIdentifier "https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-process-profiles/def/process-type/water-bodies/norm-diff"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    rim:publicationStatus rim:published ;
    rim:validityStatus rim:invalid .

